### SafeWatch API Testing File (for REST Client / Thunder Client)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Health / Status Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health HTTP/1.1

### 2. Get All Video / Feed Sources
GET {{baseUrl}}/sources HTTP/1.1

### 3. Get All Incidents
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents HTTP/1.1

### 4. Acknowledge Incident
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents/1/acknowledge HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Resolve Incident
POST {{baseUrl}}/incidents/1/resolve HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. AI Service Health (YOLO backend)
GET http://localhost:8000/health HTTP/1.1
